## Usage

### Hover Hint

Short hints with low intrusion.

::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="TooltipHoverDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TxTooltip content="Hint">
      <TxButton variant="ghost">Hover me</TxButton>
    </TxTooltip>
    <TxTooltip content="Info">
      <TxButton variant="ghost">Info</TxButton>
    </TxTooltip>
  </template>
---
::

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <template>
    <TxTooltip content="Copied">
      <TxButton variant="ghost">Copy</TxButton>
    </TxTooltip>
  </template>
---
:::

### Best Practices

- Keep tooltip text short and avoid multiline hints.
- Keep spacing light around the trigger element.
- Put visual complexity in `anchor`, not in tooltip-specific props.
- Do not place forms, long explanations, or bulk actions inside Tooltip; upgrade complex content to `TxPopover` / `TxDrawer`.

